# GitHub serves the private advisory form only to signed-in users, so an
# anonymous check reads it as missing. SECURITY.md links it.
^https://github\.com/Comfy-Org/awesome-comfy/security/advisories/new$

# Worked-example placeholders in SUBMISSION_GUIDELINES.md and CONTRIBUTING.md.
# They are meant to be fictional: a checker that resolved them would mean
# someone had registered the example names.
^https://url/?$
^https://github\.com/example/
^https://lanternfish\.example/
^https://youtu\.be/example$

# The registry API, which answers 401 without a key. CONTRIBUTING.md cites it
# as the way to verify a node pack, not as a page to read.
^https://api\.comfy\.org/nodes
